    historyContent: {
      origins: "Klaverjassen developed from the Jass family of games that originated in the Low Countries. The name comes from 'Klaverjas' (Jack of Clubs), reflecting the importance of the Jack in trump. The game became the dominant card game in the Netherlands during the 19th and 20th centuries.",
